WEBVTT

00:16:00.246 --> 00:16:01.537
I wished to tell him

00:16:01.579 --> 00:16:04.496
that one does not have to say
that a bad thing is good,

00:16:04.537 --> 00:16:06.996
that a crash is from God
and so a crash is good,

00:16:07.037 --> 00:16:08.871
a broken neck is good.

00:16:08.912 --> 00:16:12.079
One can say that a bad thing sucks,

00:16:12.121 --> 00:16:15.329
but that this natural world
still has many glories.

00:16:16.579 --> 00:16:19.079
I wished to tell him that, in the end,

00:16:19.079 --> 00:16:20.787
our mandate is clear.

00:16:21.579 --> 00:16:23.954
We have to rise above bad fortune.

00:16:24.371 --> 00:16:27.371
We have to be in the good
and enjoy the good --

00:16:27.412 --> 00:16:31.621
study and work
and adventure and friendship,